# Except: the fixed, checked-in debug key used by CI and local builds alike so every
# build shares one SHA-1 (see app/build.gradle.kts signingConfigs.debug). This is a
# debug-only key with the well-known "android"/"android" password - never a release key.
!app/ci-debug.keystore

